  "description": "Erection of a side and rear roof extension, installation of one front roof window, and removal of existing chimney stack.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed alterations to the roof, by reason of their position, size, design and appearance would be intrusive alterations, out of scale and character with this and surrounding dwellings, unbalance the pair of semi-detached houses as well as having an adverse effect on the visual amenities of the locality, harming the character and appearance of the conservation area. Thus, it is contrary to the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines, Local Plan policies CC1, CC2 and CC4 of Local Plan, policies D4 and HC1 of London Plan and the National Planning Policy Framework."
